maluos-tools (0.1.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * First version (Phase 12 slice 7, the Tools Installer): tool directories
    for Google Chrome (Google's deb, which registers Google's repository),
    Visual Studio Code (Microsoft's repository), Claude Code (Anthropic's
    native installer, per user), Codex (Ubuntu's Node.js and npm, then
    @openai/codex system-wide) and Ollama (maluctl gateway ollama install:
    the pinned, checksummed release and the gateway's backend); `maluctl
    tools` and the com.maluos.ToolsInstaller launcher.

